Fernruf

This product includes open-source software. Key runtime dependencies include
MIT/BSD/Apache-licensed libraries (see `uv.lock`). Optional CUDA wheels
(`[cuda]` extra) are proprietary — see the GPU vendor license if you install them.

Build and CI tooling (not shipped in the runtime wheel): Astral `uv` and the
`ghcr.io/astral-sh/uv` container image; GitHub Actions `astral-sh/setup-uv`.

The Asterisk container is built from the upstream `andrius/asterisk` image
(GPL-2.0); no Asterisk source is vendored in this repository.

Whisper model weights and Silero VAD are subject to their upstream licenses.
Fish Audio, OpenRouter, and your SIP provider impose separate terms of use.
